note S4 part on an empty text: part e 0 1 on count 0: o <= len holds, k <= len - o fails, trap 3 (exit
note 103). x = 7 is live in the register the old lowering read as the count.
om2
text e ""
fn plen v view uchar * to ulong
ret len v
end
fn main to int
x = ulong 7
ret int add plen part e 0 1 x
end
